#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_TakingALookAround"
msgid ""
"Ships of this sort are rare, so I'm\n"
"taking a look around.\p"
"Hmhm…\n"
"There appear to be other cabins…$"
msgstr ""
"这种船很少见，所以我四处看看。\p"
"嗯嗯……好像还有其他客舱……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaIntro"
msgid ""
"What on earth would compel you to\n"
"come here? You must be curious!$"
msgstr ""
"到底是什么让你来到这种地方？\n"
"你一定是好奇心很强吧！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaDefeat"
msgid "Not just curious, but also strong…$"
msgstr "不光好奇心强，实力也很强……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:47
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The man next door…\p"
"He says he's just sightseeing,\n"
"but I don't know about that.$"
msgstr ""
"隔壁的那个男人……\p"
"他说他只是来观光的，\n"
"但我可不这么认为。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaRegister"
msgid ""
"You're such a tough TRAINER!\n"
"Let me register you as a memento!$"
msgstr ""
"你真是个厉害的训练家！\n"
"让我把你登记下来作个纪念吧！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"What on earth would compel you to\n"
"come back? You must really be curious!$"
msgstr ""
"到底是什么让你又回到这里？\n"
"你的好奇心一定很强吧！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaRematchDefeat"
msgid "Aren't you too strong?$"
msgstr "你是不是太强了？$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_ThaliaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'm sure that man's up to something!\n"
"He just acts so suspiciously!$"
msgstr ""
"那个男人一定在打什么主意！\n"
"他的举动太可疑了！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_DemetriusIntro"
msgid ""
"Waaah!\n"
"I've been found! …Huh?$"
msgstr "哇啊！被找到了！……咦？$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_DemetriusDefeat"
msgid "Oh, you're not my mom.$"
msgstr "哦，你不是我妈妈啊。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms_1F_Text_DemetriusPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm in trouble with my mom, so I ran.\n"
"Keep it a secret where I am!$"
msgstr ""
"我惹妈妈生气了，所以就跑出来了。\n"
"别告诉别人我在这里哦！$"
